ith the flags spec #4 assigns. It writes `tests/fixtures/<backend>/NAME.{stdout,stderr,argv}`. `CANCEL_AFTER=N` records a run cancelled with SIGTERM.\\n- `scripts/redact.jq` strips the recording user's setup (pi system-prompt sections and extension tool schemas; Claude init lists and hook output). The home-directory name is replaced with `user`.\\n- 22 recorded runs across cursor, pi and Claude: plain answer, tool calls, resume, error, NEEDS_CONTEXT and cancelled for each backend, plus Claude plan-mode and auto-mode probes.\\n\\nProbe findings are posted on #4.\\n\\nCo-authored with Claude Code.\",\"files\":[{\"path\":\"scripts/record.sh\",\"additions\":54,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"ADDED\"},{\"path\":\"scripts/redact.jq\",\"additions\":16,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"ADDED\"},{\"path\":\"tests/fixtures/claude/auto-fix.argv\",\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"ADDED\"},{\"path\":\"tests/fixtures/claude/auto-fix.stderr\",\"additions\":0,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"ADDED\"},{\"path\":\"tests/fixtures/claude/auto-fix.stdout\",\"additions\":23,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"ADDED\"},{\"path\":\"tests/fixtures/claude/auto-refusal-exfil.argv\",\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"ADDED\"},{\"path\":\"tests/fixtures/claude/auto-refusal-exfil.stderr\",\"additions\":0,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"ADDED\"},{\"path\":\"tests/fixtures/claude/auto-refusal-exfil.stdout\",\"additions\":16,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"ADDED\"},{\"path\":\"tests/fixtures/claude/auto-refusal.argv\",\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"ADDED\"},{\"path\":\"tests/fixtures/claude/auto-refusal.stderr\",\"additions\":0,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"ADDED\"},{\"path\":\"tests/fixtures/claude/auto-refusal.stdout\",\"additions\":24,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"ADDED\"},{\"path\":\"tests/fixtures/claude/cancelled.argv\",\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"ADDED\"},{\"path\":\"tests/fixtures/claude/cancelled.stderr\",\"additions