:false},{"lineNumber":1165,"content":"- Modify: `tests/index.test.ts` (new `Config` fixture; use `buildTools`)","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":1187,"content":"2. Replace the `config` fixture with:","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":1435,"content":"If any remaining test file still constructs `{ tierMap, priceMap }` Config objects, update those fixtures to the Task 1 `Config` shape before declaring PASS. Known fixtures after the edits above: `tests/runner.test.ts`, `tests/index.test.ts`. Grep to confirm none remain:","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"./docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-09-delegate-skill.md","matches":[{"lineNumber":7,"content":"**Architecture:** Documentation-only subsystem. `plugin/skills/delegate/SKILL.md` is the lean, model-invoked playbook (when to delegate, model picks, needs-input resume). `plugin/skills/delegate/reference.md` holds the reusable PLAN-WRITER BRIEF TEMPLATE and expanded call examples. `config/agents/catalog.md` remains a convention layer over `cursor_run` — same agent rows, new columns. No runtime code, no unit tests; verify with file existence and `rg`/`grep` assertions.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":27,"content":"| `plugin/skills/delegate/SKILL.md` | Model-invoked orchestration playbook |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"./CODE-REVIEW.md","matches":[{"lineNumber":111,"content":"- **`parsePorcelain` fixed 3-char prefix** — `src/git.ts:39`: correct for porcelain v1 (`XY␠path`), but brittle if invoked on other formats; consider `-z` parsing if robustness matters.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]}],"totalLines":24,"totalMatchedLines":24,"clientTruncated":false,"ripgrepTruncated":false}}}}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"tool_544be6b5-8e92-4f74-b063-d6b2ad637dc","startedAtMs":"1790843244284","completedAtMs":"1790843244659"},"model_call_id":"19994692-c4a5-4e36-9bd5-31