sed scaffolding. Lane-8-ci, preflight-7, and ponytail-19 likely belong to future parsers and exceed the current scope.\",\"session_id\":\"04dee1e2-96f1-4825-9926-d7d625c11b45\",\"timestamp_ms\":1790843258464}","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":193,"content":"{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"subtype\":\"started\",\"call_id\":\"tool_2471c17c-a098-49b2-b4b4-6ec5343cef3\",\"tool_call\":{\"grepToolCall\":{\"args\":{\"pattern\":\"preflight-7|lane-8|ponytail-19|review-19\",\"path\":\"/Users/user/work/delegate-6-record-fixtures\",\"caseInsensitive\":false,\"multiline\":false,\"toolCallId\":\"tool_2471c17c-a098-49b2-b4b4-6ec5343cef3\",\"offset\":0}},\"hookAdditionalContexts\":[],\"toolCallId\":\"tool_2471c17c-a098-49b2-b4b4-6ec5343cef3\",\"startedAtMs\":\"1790843258535\"},\"model_call_id\":\"19994692-c4a5-4e36-9bd5-317371d067e3-10-a0cj\",\"session_id\":\"04dee1e2-96f1-4825-9926-d7d625c11b45\",\"timestamp_ms\":1790843258465}","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"./tests/fixtures/claude/review-18.stdout","matches":[{"lineNumber":15,"content":"{\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01HGCobLa7Nx9QjMUKTdjMFz\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"title:\\ttest: recording script and redacted headless fixtures (#6)\\nstate:\\tDRAFT\\nauthor:\\tuser (Amogh Akshintala)\\nlabels:\\t\\nassignees:\\t\\nreviewers:\\t\\nprojects:\\t\\nmilestone:\\t\\nnumber:\\t18\\nurl:\\thttps://github.com/user/delegate/pull/18\\nadditions:\\t1972\\ndeletions:\\t0\\nauto-merge:\\tdisabled\\n--\\nFixes #6\\n\\n- `scripts/record.sh BACKEND MODEL CAPABILITY NAME [CWD] [SESSION] < prompt` runs one prompt through cursor-agent, pi or claude with the flags spec #4 assigns. It writes `tests/fixtures/<backend>/NAME.{stdout,stderr,argv}`. `CANCEL_AFTER=N` records a run cancelled with SIGTERM.\\n- `scripts/redact.jq` strips the recording user's setup (pi system-prompt sections and extension tool schemas; Claude init lists and hook output). The home-directory name is replaced with `user`.\\n- 22 recorded runs across cursor, pi and Claude: plain answer, [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":29,"content":"{\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"Exit code 1\\n21:The tool has also grown more surface than it uses. Across 413 real `cursor_run` calls, every one ran in the background, `plan` capability was never used, `allowPartialCommit` and `idleMs` were never set, `cursor_wait_any` ran twice, and several parameters (`verifyCommands`, `promptPreamble`, `requireNonClaude`, the `allowUnsandboxed` second signal) only add prompt text or guard against cases that never happen. Eight MCP tools and fourteen run parameters cost schema tokens in every session and make the skill long.\\n60:28. As an orchestrating agent, I want resume to reuse the job's model, directory, capability and gate, so that I cannot forget a setting on the follow-up.\\n73:41. As a user, I want cursor read-write runs unsandboxed, so that delegates can clone, push and open PRs.\\n79:47. As a user, I want my existing host profile moved to the new config location by setup, so that my setting [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":34,"content":"{\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01Fm8Gc4aDbXufDGJtXAT6yw\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"HEAD:tests/fixtures/claude/auto-fix.stdout:1\\nHEAD:tests/fixtures/cursor/lane-8-ci-repair.stdout:5\\nHEAD:tests/fixtures/cursor/lane-8-ci.stdout:4\",\"is_error\":false}]},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"3dfd18ba-a3ed-4a44-bd90-c4ca03e8efdd\",\"uuid\":\"742dce75-c52a-4d39-a90a-5935e164fb95\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-01T08:27:21.115Z\",\"tool_use_result\":{\"stdout\":\"HEAD:tests/fixtures/claude/auto-fix.stdout:1\\nHEAD:tests/fixtures/cursor/lane-8-ci-repair.